50:Malcolm: We're back here. A sad sight.
51:[$f3b8b8]Dyron[$ffffff]: That obelisk was a statue in honor of Truth himself.
52:Malcolm: I'd like to know what he was like. I know there are legends, but it's not the same as meeting him in person. He must have been a great ruler.
53:[$f3b8b8]Dyron[$ffffff]: Yes. We owe much to him, yet we don't know much about him.
54:Malcolm: Perhaps it's better. Who knows what secrets he held?
55:[$f3b8b8]Dyron[$ffffff]: And yet, Iris was wrong.
56:Malcolm: About what :5_00155? 
57:[$f3b8b8]Dyron[$ffffff]: She claimed that when I returned to Valtaria, I would find it in flames and suffering. Instead, it is completely destroyed.
58:Malcolm: We will rebuild it.
59:[$f3b8b8]Dyron[$ffffff]: Just as I remembered it. It will regain its former charm.
60:Malcolm: If you don't mind, I'll make a few improvements. I've patented a few designs that could strengthen Valtaria even further.
66:Malcolm: Wow, what's that? Earthquake:5_00144?
67:[$f3b8b8]Dyron[$ffffff]: I have made a mistake.
68:[$f3b8b8]Dyron[$ffffff]: Save yourselves. Save!
61:Malcolm: Your glove:5_00142 Why did it start glowing?
62:[$f3b8b8]Dyron[$ffffff]: What?
63:[$00ffee]Glove Whisper[$ffffff]: Dyyyyrrrroooooonnnn.
64:[$f3b8b8]Dyron[$ffffff]: And it keeps talking.
65:Malcolm: And I thought I was going on vacation.
69:Townspeople: Run! Everyone run! AAAAAAA
70:[$d5d5d5]Golem[$ffffff]: D.Y.R.O.N
71:Malcolm: A friend from the trip? 
72:[$f3b8b8]Dyron[$ffffff]: Not good...
73:[$d5d5d5]Golem[$ffffff]: You think you can just walk away from the creator.
74:[$d5d5d5]Golem[$ffffff]: Mwahahaha
75:[$d5d5d5]Golem[$ffffff]: You were wrong.
76:-To Be Continued-
77:[$d5d5d5]Golem[$ffffff]: D.Y.